      "message": "Drop accidentally-committed backend lockfile (npm install side effect)\n\nThe backend has historically used `npm install --omit=dev` in the\nDockerfile (no `npm ci`), and committing the lockfile would change\nthe install semantics for future PRs. Removing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
